b easier! It\u2019ll all reset after the contract, so no need to hoard your money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Safety Violations modify the warehouse to add even more chaos! If the shift was tough before, just wait until the lights go out! </p></li></ul>","developers":["Aggro Crab"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583210/9eb7862ff717a04dcc02123ce1e773a3e1c226af/header.jpg?t=1773857293","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Aggro Crab 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583210/442136185/7b55a2239d478bcc478accb60da7ff80c6beed98/1759263079/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759424228","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583210/442136185/7b55a2239d478bcc478accb60da7ff80c6beed98/1759263079/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759424228","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583210/442136185/7b55a2239d478bcc478accb60da7ff80c6beed98/1759263079/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759424228","id":257209607,"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209607/759c735498abd4c524cfc8f5537c4141d150ffc3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759424228"}],"name":"Crashout Crew","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (32-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><str