3857293","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583210/538cdb17cd32df4851d82ceb3f3841ba6d020dcd/ss_538cdb17cd32df4851d82ceb3f3841ba6d020dcd.600x338.jpg?t=1773857293"}],"short_description":"Time to clock in at DE NILE SHIPPING, the world\u2019s \u201cmost efficient\u201d warehouse! Work together in online co-op with up to 4 players to fulfill orders of increasingly chaotic, physics-based boxes. Time is money, and safety is no concern\u2026 just try not to crash out!","steam_appid":3583210,"support_info":{"email":"contact@aggrocrab.com","url":"https://aggrocrab.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://aggrocrab.com"}